  "title": "WPP unifies Natura and Avon Communications in Latin America with a new dedicated operation",
  "summary": "WPP today announces the creation of a dedicated communication and strategy operation designed exclusively for Natura, a leader in Beauty and Personal Care (BPC) in Latin America. This marks the first time Natura has consolidated its creative, media and production disciplines for both its brands under the management of a single strategic partner – a decisive step within a strategy to simplify and integrate its marketing operations in Latin America.",
